<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>HR Policies — KLAUS Multiparking India</title>
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Barlow+Condensed:wght@600;700&family=Inter:wght@400;500;600&family=IBM+Plex+Mono:wght@500&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
  :root{
    --navy: #23283C;
    --navy-deep: #171A28;
    --steel: #5B6072;
    --steel-light: #F0F0F2;
    --red: #FF6F00;
    --white: #FFFFFF;
    --line: rgba(35,40,60,0.14);
  }
  *{box-sizing:border-box;}
  body{
    margin:0;
    min-height:100vh;
    background:var(--steel-light);
    color:var(--navy);
    font-family:'Inter', sans-serif;
  }

  header.topbar{
    background:var(--navy);
    padding:18px 6vw;
    display:flex;
    align-items:center;
    justify-content:space-between;
  }
  header.topbar img{
    height:34px;
    display:block;
  }
  header.topbar .tag{
    font-family:'IBM Plex Mono', monospace;
    font-size:11px;
    letter-spacing:0.14em;
    color:rgba(255,255,255,0.65);
    text-transform:uppercase;
  }

  .levels{
    position:relative;
    height:6px;
    width:100%;
    display:flex;
  }
  .levels span{flex:1; height:100%;}
  .levels span:nth-child(1){background:var(--red);}
  .levels span:nth-child(2){background:var(--navy);}
  .levels span:nth-child(3){background:var(--steel);}
  .levels span:nth-child(4){background:var(--navy);}
  .levels span:nth-child(5){background:var(--red);}

  main{
    min-height:calc(100vh - 60px);
    display:flex;
    align-items:center;
    justify-content:center;
    padding:60px 6vw 100px;
    position:relative;
    overflow:hidden;
  }
  .deck-bg{
    position:absolute;
    inset:0;
    display:flex;
    flex-direction:column;
    justify-content:flex-end;
    gap:14px;
    padding:0 0 40px;
    z-index:0;
    pointer-events:none;
  }
  .deck-bg .deck{
    height:10px;
    background:linear-gradient(90deg, transparent, rgba(35,40,60,0.06) 20%, rgba(35,40,60,0.06) 80%, transparent);
    width:100%;
  }

  .card{
    position:relative;
    z-index:1;
    max-width:640px;
    width:100%;
    text-align:center;
  }
  .eyebrow{
    display:inline-flex;
    align-items:center;
    gap:8px;
    font-family:'IBM Plex Mono', monospace;
    font-size:11.5px;
    letter-spacing:0.16em;
    color:var(--red);
    border:1px solid var(--red);
    padding:6px 14px;
    border-radius:2px;
    text-transform:uppercase;
    margin-bottom:28px;
  }
  h1{
    font-family:'Barlow Condensed', sans-serif;
    font-weight:700;
    font-size:clamp(2.6rem, 6vw, 4rem);
    line-height:1.02;
    letter-spacing:-0.01em;
    text-transform:uppercase;
    margin:0 0 20px;
  }
  h1 .accent{color:var(--red);}
  p.sub{
    color:var(--steel);
    font-size:1.1rem;
    max-width:48ch;
    margin:0 auto 44px;
    line-height:1.6;
  }
  .hint{
    display:inline-flex;
    align-items:center;
    gap:10px;
    font-family:'IBM Plex Mono', monospace;
    font-size:12px;
    color:var(--steel);
    border-top:1px solid var(--line);
    padding-top:22px;
    margin-top:6px;
  }
  .hint strong{color:var(--navy);}
  .hint a{color:var(--red); text-decoration:none;}
  .hint a:hover{text-decoration:underline;}

  footer{
    background:var(--navy-deep);
    color:rgba(255,255,255,0.55);
    font-family:'IBM Plex Mono', monospace;
    font-size:11px;
    text-align:center;
    padding:20px 6vw;
    letter-spacing:0.04em;
  }

  @media (max-width:600px){
    header.topbar{padding:16px 20px;}
    header.topbar .tag{display:none;}
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<header class="topbar">
  <img src="https://www.klausindia.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/08/kmp-india-logo-positive-rgb.png" alt="KLAUS Multiparking India">
  <span class="tag">Human Resources</span>
</header>
<div class="levels"><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span></div>

<main>
  <div class="deck-bg">
    <div class="deck"></div><div class="deck"></div><div class="deck"></div>
    <div class="deck"></div><div class="deck"></div>
  </div>

  <div class="card">
    <span class="eyebrow">● Internal — KLAUS Multiparking India</span>
    <h1>HR Policies, <span class="accent">Answered</span></h1>
    <p class="sub">Leave, benefits, conduct, attendance, or anything else about working at KLAUS Multiparking India — ask the HR Assistant in the bottom-right corner and get a straight answer.</p>
    <div class="hint">Chat not loading, or need a person instead? <a href="mailto:hr@klausindia.com">hr@klausindia.com</a></div>
  </div>
</main>

<footer>
  KLAUS MULTIPARKING INDIA · HR ASSISTANT · INTERNAL USE ONLY
</footer>

    <script src="https://cdn.botpress.cloud/webchat/v3.7/inject.js"></script>
<script src="https://files.bpcontent.cloud/2026/08/04/05/20260804052920-70XAANKT.js" defer></script>


</body>
</html>
